[ti:I Didn’t Mean to Smile]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:00.00]You weren’t saying anything
[00:02.44]Just walking next to me
[00:06.32]Same street, same morning light
[00:09.84]But something felt easy
[00:12.76]I caught my face in a window
[00:18.04]Didn’t recognise that while
[00:21.44]I didn’t mean to smile
[00:23.30]Didn’t plan to stay awhile
[00:25.08]Something shifted quietly
[00:26.76]Like the sun moved just a mile
[00:28.96]I didn’t mean to smile
[00:30.88]It just happened for a while
[00:32.62]No big words, no big scene
[00:34.74]Just you… and something green
[00:45.74]You laughed about nothing
[00:46.58]And I laughed too
[00:48.02]Not because it was funny
[00:50.44]Just because it was you
[00:51.90]I felt my shoulders drop
[00:55.64]Like they’d been waiting all day
[01:00.58]Maybe nothing changed
[01:03.26]Maybe everything did
[01:05.14]You didn’t move the world
[01:07.16]You just moved my sky
[01:34.30]I didn’t mean to smile
[01:35.76]Didn’t see it coming on
[01:37.54]Something in me grew
[01:39.00]While we were moving on
